&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height:45pt;min-height:45pt;"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:7.3pt;padding-right:7.2pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;line-height:9pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;font-size:9pt;"&gt;気温上昇による空調運転&lt;/span&gt;コスト増加&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:16.2pt;padding-right:7.2pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:9pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;・約半数の店舗で、一部インテリジェント制御を含む空調制御システムを導入済&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:16.2pt;padding-right:7.2pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:9pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;・順次最新の高効率空調設備への更新&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:16.2pt;padding-right:7.2pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:9pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;・全店舗への空調インテリジェント制御システム導入&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:16.2pt;padding-right:7.2pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:9pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;・エアカーテン導入&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height:54pt;min-height:54pt;"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:7.3pt;padding-right:7.2pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;line-height:9pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;font-size:9pt;"&gt;自然災害激甚化に対応する防災関連商品の需要拡大&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:16.2pt;padding-right:7.2pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:9pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;・防災関連商品の売場、商品を拡充済&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:16.2pt;padding-right:7.2pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:9pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;・自治体と災害協定を締結済&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:16.2pt;padding-right:7.2pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:9pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;・災害時の商品ニーズに合わせ営業早期再開体制を確立済&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:16.2pt;padding-right:7.2pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:9pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;・気温上昇・防災関連商品開発動向を注視する体制構築&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p style="clear:both; line-height:0.75pt; width:100%; font-size:0.75pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;</jpcrp030000-asr_E30501-000:StrategyClimateChangeTextBlock>
  <jpcrp030000-asr_E30501-000:ReferenceToOtherInformationStrategyClimateChange contextRef="FilingDateInstant">「Net-Zero Emissions by 2050 Scenario」</jpcrp030000-asr_E30501-000:ReferenceToOtherInformationStrategyClimateChange>
  <jpcrp030000-asr_E30501-000:ReferenceToOtherInformation2StrategyClimateChange contextRef="FilingDateInstant">「Announced Pledges Case」</jpcrp030000-asr_E30501-000:ReferenceToOtherInformation2StrategyClimateChange>
  <jpcrp030000-asr_E30501-000:ReferenceToOtherInformation3StrategyClimateChange contextRef="FilingDateInstant">「Stated Policies Scenario」</jpcrp030000-asr_E30501-000:ReferenceToOtherInformation3StrategyClimateChange>
  <jpcrp030000-asr_E30501-000:MetricsAndTargetsClimateChangeTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant">&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:18pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;②　指標と目標&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:27pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;温室効果ガス（ＧＨＧ）排出量を指標としScope１,２に関して2025年にＧＨＧ排出量を43%削減（2013年比）および2050年までにＧＨＧ排出量ゼロを目標としております。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:18pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;　指標&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="margin-left:27pt;margin-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:1pt;"&gt;
&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;border:solid 0pt #000000;width:400pt;table-layout:fixed;"&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style="width:200pt;min-width:200pt;"/&gt;
&lt;col style="width:200pt;min-width:200pt;"/&gt;
&lt;/colgroup&gt;
&lt;tr style="height:18pt;min-height:18pt;"&gt;
&lt;td colspan="2" style="vertical-align:top;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;background-color:#d8d8d8;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:center;padding-left:56.1pt;padding-right:7.2pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-48.9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;line-height:18pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;b&gt;ＧＨＧ排出量&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;sup&gt;※7&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
